@meeting train.m13.torres-zeke
// Pillar 5 Step 4, M13 leak hunting (from Day 12): the Works officer on shift at your first drip. Seat E2.
title: Follow the wet
from: Zeke Torres
gist: Torres showed you leak hunting: read the puddle, follow the wet back to the joint, then tighten or replace it.
== lines
torres-zeke: A drip! Best job on the ship. It's a treasure hunt.   [gesture]
torres-zeke > you: Follow the wet, not the noise. Well, both.
torres-zeke: Look at the puddle. Which way's it running? From above? Along the wall?
torres-zeke: Wetter means closer. When you find the joint, tighten it. If it's worn through, swap it.
